  "description": "Lycia.Extensions.Scheduling provides transport-independent durable scheduling for the Lycia Saga framework:\n            - SchedulerWorker with schedule claiming, leases, renewal, fencing and idempotency\n            - Redis-backed and in-memory schedule stores and scheduling registries\n            - Topology manifest and vacuum workers for scheduling resource lifecycle\n            - Scheduling metrics, tracing, health checks and validated configuration\n            - Works with any Lycia transport; native transport delays are optional optimizations",
  "id": "Lycia.Extensions.Scheduling",
